-- =============================================================================
-- Shared sales for the report tests (Phase 4A). Included right after
-- helpers/setup.psql with
--   \ir helpers/report_sales.psql
-- Written directly as the test superuser, with fixed times, so each report's
-- numbers can be checked exactly. November 2026 holds:
--
--   S1  ...5c1  staff,  10 Nov 12:00 UTC, no customer
--       L1 ...7c1  string (cost $8) x2 at $20, $25 before a $5-each discount
--                  (no reason), list price $25
--       L2 ...7c2  overgrip (no cost) x1 at $10, price changed from $12,
--                  reason "Scuffed"
--       tax $4.13, paid $54.13 cash
--   S2  ...5c2  admin,  11 Nov 15:00 UTC, customer Pat
--       L3 ...7c3  stringing charge for job ...e1, $30
--       L4 ...7c4  gift card ...6c1 load, $25
--       ticket discount approved by the admin, reason "Loyal customer"
--       no tax, paid $55 by card
--   R1  ...8c1  admin,  12 Nov 10:00 UTC: one string from S1 back, $20 + $1.65
--       tax, to cash
--   S3  ...5c3  staff,  1 Oct 09:00 UTC: 5 strings at $20 (outside November)
-- =============================================================================

